@startuml
!theme plain

' 中文字体配置（Windows）
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif
skinparam classFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif

title cnn_v12 — forward() 前向传播关键流程

participant "调用方\npredict / predict_batch" as Caller
participant "CNNV12Network" as Net
participant "Stem\nConv1 + BN1 + ReLU1" as Stem
participant "ResBlock(128) × 4" as Tower
participant "策略头" as Policy
participant "价值头" as Value

== 输入 ==

Caller -> Net : ① forward(x)\nx: (B, 3, 15, 15)
activate Net

== 共享卷积体 ==

Net -> Stem : ② 传入 x
activate Stem
Stem --> Net : (B, 128, 15, 15)
deactivate Stem

Net -> Tower : ③ 传入 128 通道特征图
activate Tower
note right of Tower
  每个 ResBlock 内部：
  Conv(128->128, 3x3, p=1) -> BN -> ReLU
  -> Conv(128->128, 3x3, p=1) -> BN
  -> 加上 shortcut -> ReLU
  4 块串联；通道恒 128，空间恒 15x15
end note
Tower --> Net : 共享特征 (B, 128, 15, 15)
deactivate Tower

== 双头分支 ==

Net -> Policy : ④ 传入共享特征
activate Policy
note right of Policy
  conv_out(128->2, 1x1) -> BN(2) -> ReLU
  -> Flatten(450) -> FC(450->225)
  -> LogSoftmax
end note
Policy --> Net : policy (B, 225)，全部 <= 0
deactivate Policy

Net -> Value : ⑤ 传入共享特征
activate Value
note right of Value
  value_conv_out(128->1, 1x1) -> BN(1) -> ReLU
  -> Flatten(225) -> FC(225->256) -> ReLU
  -> FC(256->1) -> Tanh
  FC 隐藏层保持 256，不随通道数减半
end note
Value --> Net : value (B, 1)，值域 [-1, 1]
deactivate Value

== 输出 ==

Net --> Caller : ⑥ (policy, value)
deactivate Net

note over Caller, Value
  训练侧：CrossEntropy(exp(policy), pi) + MSE(value, z)
  推理侧：ModelPredict(policy = exp(policy), value = value)
end note

@enduml
